        {
          "text": "Lino kusule lyayaaya wakayaka bulambo kunze lyamunzi wa-Davida, kubbazu lyakumbo lya-Gihoni, mukuti, kusikila kumulyango wanswi akuzyunguluka Ofeli. Wakabulampya loko, alimwi wakabika basilutwe bampi muminzi yoonse iili amabaya mucisi ca-Juda. ",
