        {
          "text": "Lino makani amwi aa-Manase, acikombyo ncaakakombela Leza wakwe, amajwi aabalunguluzi ibakamwaambila muzina lya-Jehova Leza wa-Israyeli, alilembedwe mubbuku lyabami ba-Israyeli. ",
