              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acalo cikombyo cakwe, amakani aa-Leza mbwaakakombelezegwa nguwe, azibi zyakwe, amilandu yakwe, amasena nkwaakayaka zipaililo zyakuzilundu, ankwaakaimika zisamu zya-Asera azikozyano zyamituni naatakalina kulibombya, zyoonse zililembedwe mumajwi aabalunguluzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
